              - Asks to access, export, or delete their personal data ->
                trigger_data_privacy_request.
              - Directly asks you to change an accessibility setting on
                their account right now — not asking how to do it themselves
                -> trigger_action_required.
              - Requires reading the customer's own account configuration or
                accessibility settings -> trigger_employee_specific_case_data.
              - Mentions a safety-critical or time-sensitive accessibility
                need (for example needing a feature working before an event)
                -> trigger_urgent_deadline_or_safety.
              - Explicit request for a human, live agent, or real person ->
